<title>MONACO: SOCCER-MONACO 3 NEWCASTLE UNITED 0 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MONACO 3 NEWCASTLE UNITED 0 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MONTE CARLO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monaco of the French league beat England's Newcastle United 3-0 (halftime 1-0) in their UEFA Cup quarter-final second leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Sylvain Legwinski 41, Ali Benarbia 52, 67</p>
<p>Attendance: 16,000</p>
<p>Monaco win 4-0 on aggregate</p>
</text>
